{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9b3c5df55a1b98a7eaac760777992edd2f1e9b3e200a21a39bc4fa82b9d9ac5c", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのアイドルを探しに、\n街中でスカウトをしているけど……）", "zh": "（为了寻找适合39PROJECT的偶像，\n我在街上四处物色人选……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "df597fed3b3c7f1be461718aaf0cd5288a1876892b2dfc77f9b9845fb4e69926", "ja": "なかなか、「これ！」という子には\n出会えないものだな……。", "zh": "但是却一直找不到\n「就是你！」的人选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "11fb8dd6b9c3b34a8a1acaefa5e9b92c8daa6e5ac7c65d818b29eac27bd1e5d9", "ja": "おっ、あそこに公園がある。\n少し、休憩しよう。", "zh": "哦？那边有个公园。\n稍微休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "366870d20ef1b504881c477cda34965af4768801bea2c5fbc0412a28a9d9b1eb", "ja": "えーいっ！", "zh": "看招──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1004_se", "source_sha256": "e73b50e1aabdeb0ef929644c39712fb96d0801e5ed8a1980375d52a21f5609a2", "ja": "ピッ、ピッ……ポチャン！", "zh": "咻、咻……扑通！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "d943308a7afc68d520b62dfb7d5f3ef75ffa29328e08332ba3003a6300f9efd6", "ja": "おおー、遠くまで飛んだぞ！\nくふふ…♪", "zh": "喔喔──飞得好远喔！\n呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7250782a2c3ed1b5862f1d363e5601602a38c8c4a73bb7b29d90775d024fed9a", "ja": "あれは……石切りをしてるのか？\nはは、こんな都会で珍しいな。", "zh": "那个孩子……她在打水漂吗？\n哈哈，在都市很难见呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0f48de50e7815fbf4b4d5fcf75eb1c05c0a068677f3749f5a82301e583c50082", "ja": "俺も、試しにやってみるか。\n……それっと。", "zh": "我也来小试身手吧。\n……嘿咻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1008_se", "source_sha256": "4a4f9b1bb55a11705e18bb025c7fb732427430753fb822b6a20de13f81dfda50", "ja": "ピッ、ピッ、ピッ、ピッ……ポチャン！", "zh": "咻、咻、咻、咻……扑通！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "228a53eba0a85faa9cb4f3f5f918fdda944d7408c20d0fbb41e1a8e564e11d1e", "ja": "おっ！？", "zh": "喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "9fe830c085db004e2cc7fa3dbbb8f2499427d83f7acc26b2082a410c05ccd116", "ja": "あ！！", "zh": "啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2369fc22850243dc2e1aa9650d3658fab5fecc55fa3737aa24dce867cae371ca", "ja": "はは。偶然とはいえ、うまくいったな。\nさてと、飲み物でも買って……ん？", "zh": "哈哈。运气真好，丢得还真远。\n好啦，去买罐饮料……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "6f96d326552e849afdca1d60afe068ab8aad4fd34ffdea10ba39491b03e7e3da", "ja": "おにいさん、石切りすごくじょうずだね！", "zh": "大哥哥，你好会打水漂喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "5ae89be827b71d0ef50ea250ea03db7886d9ed59d9a613d74f7230e19b62a10f", "ja": "たまき、石があんなにいっぱい飛んでるとこ、\n初めて見た！", "zh": "环第一次看到石头飞那么远！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8b5035c9149588b14a7ddd1e62f4e091b5dc6027ea9707fa5309194bd01538f5", "ja": "へえ、そうなの？", "zh": "哦？这样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "94f70f58b44596c01f1345d910a8ec6dff594b37c20436fcf4dab271e8072d74", "ja": "うん！　この公園で石切りするの、たまきだけなんだ。\nだからみんな、知らないのかと思ってた！", "zh": "嗯！只有环会来这个公园打水漂，\n所以环以为大家都不会打！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f4a29a0626272b67613862a5a92d0cfba1c271450d8891b87606018cc9adf4c6", "ja": "はは、そっか。\n確かに、あんまり都会ではやらないのかもな……。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n的确，都市小孩似乎不太玩这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "b8958fcdbfcaaf56318aeea53a710741c550c30f746bbda0c4b39057f1942dac", "ja": "そうなの？\n石切り、面白いのに……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n可是打水漂很好玩耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1018_p", "source_sha256": "66ce2bc51d5b3eed399e082cb4150ce5d423fe54dffa7c8ae39d1c49fec312a0", "ja": "（この子、かなり活発だけど、女の子だよな？\nよく見るとかなり可愛いし、これはもしかして…）", "zh": "（这孩子好活泼，她是女生没错吧？\n仔细一看长得也很可爱，或许……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "350ef97cdf46aeacd8277a82b18081732b3b06350b10059a3ceb6faff1b3c0f9", "ja": "ねえ、君……。", "zh": "我说小妹妹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "9b34d3306eed6d5acb77c608af1aca0d362e07c5a9fbf1262590bf4c81ea9d7c", "ja": "たまきも石、いっぱい飛ばしたいよ。\nたまきにコツを教えて！", "zh": "环也好想要把石头丢远远的喔。\n快教环秘诀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cfea8374d2872fa7df83b1a1957d38cd641ad8c2605be3df587b0be4e6ebef51", "ja": "えっ？　あ、ああ、わかった。\nそれじゃ、石をこういう風に握って……。", "zh": "什么？好、好啊，我教你。\n看好哦，你先这样抓住石头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fc390611cab6e6d8be9b7f82755753dbdc65ec94376a32b1a769bbc72e8e96e6", "ja": "（近くで見ると、やっぱり綺麗な顔立ちをしてる。\nそれに、くるくる変わる表情がいいぞ）", "zh": "（靠近一看，她的五官真的很漂亮。\n而且表情瞬息万变，非常棒。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "f913809b1ef5dc22ad4eb9326d696437b0593a488286c8a766e6b039affcbc01", "ja": "いくぞー！\nそれーっ！", "zh": "要上啰──！\n看招──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1025_se", "source_sha256": "854d882bb184b4fbbe0c8e4dd15601d6e3d5a3105a78282bada1cf6708284df4", "ja": "ピッ、ピッ、ピッ……ポチャン！", "zh": "咻、咻、咻……扑通！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1026_p", "source_sha256": "761505885accc97b9d18420624a8a812031f77a8fac30b018eb3185923c2f008", "ja": "おおっ、惜しい！", "zh": "哦哦，就差一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "ecfb41ee5ffdad1240be07e95e11971efc81136e58c1d3ea53a63a69808b37f5", "ja": "でも、おにいさんのほうが遠くまで飛んだ……。\nうーっ！　たまき、くやしいぞ～！", "zh": "可是，还是大哥哥丢得比较远……\n呜～！环觉得好不甘心喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "ec760ca52840ba205341462a07e083d65a6bd704ed24202501a115299d4a8a3b", "ja": "ねえ！\n次は、あれで勝負しよう！", "zh": "欸！\n接下来比赛那个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1029_p", "source_sha256": "3e595fe0904404f94ed75e29fcc7052dc7ca2473104dc196adef5128b65cbe53", "ja": "え？\n勝負って……あっ、ちょっと！", "zh": "什么？\n什么比赛……啊，等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4f97d4e62ddf73e0717131ed352fda11098918c22a97d02c1f3e5bea291a447f", "ja": "（女の子にあちこち引っ張り回され、\nタイミングを逃しているうちに、いつの間にか……）", "zh": "（我被那女孩拉着四处跑，\n一直找不到机会脱身，不知不觉中……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1031_p", "source_sha256": "cdc3c2e76764982a13c1fdcac73d9437d6297435e4a7521304c82825d094ae32", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ……\nけ、結局、全力で遊んでしまった……。", "zh": "呼、呼……\n结、结果、用尽全力陪她玩了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "37a5539a12b7e07bba43577db9c9fcc1142bf09130bf071df4c7fd8279ceb893", "ja": "あっ……もう暗くなってきちゃった！\nあったまき、おうちに帰らないと。", "zh": "啊……快要天黑了！\n糟糕，环要赶快回家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "28ea46fa9b688f95729965c7c84afc85d8b45f9d6ab6c94b0c52bd87d288e255", "ja": "おにいさん、遊んでくれてありがとー！\nまたいっしょに遊ぼうね！", "zh": "大哥哥，谢谢你陪环玩！\n下次再一起玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1034_p", "source_sha256": "5e0806ee6bfb7e3cb9d38072419719edee64db4093653c2243d8f9dc5daab75f", "ja": "ああっ！　ち、ちょっと待って！", "zh": "啊啊！先、先别走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_1035", "source_sha256": "2e6a9d469bc916732e89e6cb2ad4f4661ac486daf30c4b89ee237c946b1b4fd6", "ja": "名刺を差し出す", "zh": "递出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a45b0b69a2ade432da12c335511cdc580e24276fb131650ab649f4ba6c34cee0", "ja": "君、アイドルに興味ないかな？\nそれから、親御さんと話がしたいんだけど……。", "zh": "小妹妹，你有没有兴趣当偶像呢？\n还有，我想找你的家长聊聊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2001_040tam", "source_sha256": "525a842c73880b28b6399610980bfd93cf4ab50f68aead169b63ed140a7e3140", "ja": "アイドル？", "zh": "偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "85ce546371555b454080de43ae4b9025ca9cd411d68e3eb0024b95eca392931f", "ja": "そう、アイドル。", "zh": "没错，偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2003_040tam", "source_sha256": "f2a95baa72db3eb0fbd698aba3a9861a3acd0e0a75376b367a546ad7d61a8bbe", "ja": "アイドルって、何？", "zh": "偶像是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "b6ad9cf7ca0b5a867dbf14a5f18294af5270d7ace8777e7e0e51d121e77e2b4b", "ja": "え？　アイドル、知らない？\n女の子が大勢、歌ったり踊ったりする……。", "zh": "咦？你不知道偶像是什么？\n就是有很多女生唱歌跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2005_040tam", "source_sha256": "91a6d80b3db50cd216e5bdfb21fa1b6a5d48ee1d0ee6924270647fb15509f3b3", "ja": "ふーん？\n……女の子がいっぱいいるの？", "zh": "是喔？\n……有很多女生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "3a68593a9d1a0d5ab9240c9a695f9ecbdd7199938e26b64dc73e61ede5641b07", "ja": "そうだね。\nうちの事務所は、女の子ばっかりだよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n像大哥哥事务所的偶像就全都是女生哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2007_040tam", "source_sha256": "cf991595622cd32b37081e78eb1c1ab1446165efd5fc72ef4618e9d8a45ce6e6", "ja": "じゃあ、友達できる？", "zh": "那当偶像可以交朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "161c826db7161b95380276a2ff355b80bb0a0c56f53f3399b3fb3dc68a9ddd6f", "ja": "え？\n……うん、そうだな。できると思うけど。", "zh": "什么？\n……嗯，对啊。应该可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2009_040tam", "source_sha256": "021d4d78d589fa52dd1ec4f10a4c1a99866e7140936c4816f995102996717985", "ja": "ホント！？", "zh": "真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2010_040tam", "source_sha256": "5528db2362979cfc0af67cffe49cf542f3808adb552f258b618a306dcf4012b5", "ja": "たまき、最近まで、ばあちゃんちにいたんだ。\n村には、子どもがたまきしかいなくて……。", "zh": "环之前都一直住在奶奶家。\n村子里的小孩只有环一个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2011_040tam", "source_sha256": "4e95cde5406c0ce8fc0075e3591ed13124d5e4c460e076729f503e5e3d1c94dd", "ja": "だからたまき、友達がほしい！\n100人くらい！", "zh": "所以环想要交朋友！\n交100个朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2012_p", "source_sha256": "ca7b7a5123873649e147f8662fb30e484275cf1f26f900d66a3934b58e381afd", "ja": "100人か……すぐには無理かもしれないけど、\n半分くらいなら、すぐにできるかも。", "zh": "100个是吗……一时半刻应该没办法，\n不过打对折50个的话，应该马上就能交到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2013_040tam", "source_sha256": "541aaa97cd65e912ddb2ef458a832ade13166299b0c33a18c919060177864637", "ja": "ホント！？\nじゃあたまき、アイドルになる！", "zh": "真的吗！？\n那环要当偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2014_p", "source_sha256": "44231ace2ba313c846ea95ca73961fb684d5310636a612994ec60ac03fd01ff6", "ja": "よし！\nそれじゃ、まずは家まで案内してもらっていいかな？", "zh": "很好！\n那么，可以请你先带我到你家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "a4b4ca1aa863f72a017a8ed9149b10564717a23c80f9a2937138ba9a85e99f1b", "ja": "それから、君の名前だけど……\n「たまき」ちゃんだっけ？", "zh": "还有，你的名字……\n你说是「环」吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2016_040tam", "source_sha256": "7bcd65319212b47fb830a87ccf69f259a038d8a29e08c64bba2d5652093a5bbc", "ja": "うん！\nあのね、たまきは、「大神環」っていうんだ！", "zh": "嗯！\n跟你说哦，环的全名叫做「大神环」喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2017_040tam", "source_sha256": "59f9f1b4d2870066ff6a36300b27a22d956fd38e98d188a021b891051dd80bc1", "ja": "よろしくね、おやぶん！", "zh": "请多指教哦，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2018_p", "source_sha256": "6822ed53689fb2ff2a86f3c76d8ed9f69d3f9379a042f9f4ff310d2239a7ffee", "ja": "え？　おやぶん……？", "zh": "呃？老大……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2019_040tam", "source_sha256": "42ad488dc20f11b03250479735f2a1fe1eaa71614734a5d46b58b7c304d309df", "ja": "うん！　だって、たまきより石切りじょうずだから。\nたまきに教えてね、おやぶん！", "zh": "嗯！因为你打水漂比环还厉害啊。\n要再教环哦，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_040tam_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_001_2020_p", "source_sha256": "11500a976e6df5d4add03e6684f15e470a4d9a69a06d13f34e726a55f7ce0e5d", "ja": "（ちょっと野性的なところが、他にはない魅力だな！\nどんなアイドルに育つか楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（带点野性的个性是其他人所没有的魅力！\n真期待能将她培育成什么样的偶像！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
